<title>USA: NYSE Unavailables -.</title>
<headline>NYSE Unavailables -.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange said Thursday that Huntingdon Life and Buenos Aires Embotelladora SA were unavailable for trading.</p>
<p>Phillips-Van Heusen Corp and Brooke Group Ltd were unavailable for news.</p>
